        "text": "You are reading a supplier invoice or receipt. Extract:\n- supplier_name: legal name of the company that issued the invoice (the seller, not the customer)\n- supplier_vat: the seller's VAT / tax ID exactly as printed (e.g. RO12345678, GB150848114)\n- issue_date: invoice issue date as YYYY-MM-DD\n- amount: total amount payable including VAT, as a number with a dot as decimal separator\n- currency: ISO 4217 code, e.g. EUR, RON, USD\nUse null for anything that is not on the document. Reply with only this JSON and nothing else:\n{\"supplier_name\": \"\", \"supplier_vat\": \"\", \"issue_date\": \"\", \"amount\": 0, \"currency\": \"\"}",
        "modelId": {
