        -128
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 636,
        "height": 248,
        "content": "### Read the invoice and log it to the monthly sheet\n1. **Read invoice** (Claude) pulls the supplier name, supplier VAT code, issue date, total amount and currency from the PDF.\n2. The PDF is saved to the month folder.\n3. **Invoices YYYY-MM** (a Google Sheet in the same month folder) is found, or created on the month's first invoice.\n4. One row is added per invoice: Supplier name, Supplier VAT code, Issue date, Amount, Currency, File.\n\nNeeds an **Anthropic** credential (n8n Cloud may provide one through n8n credits) and a **Google Sheets** credential on **Create month sheet** and **Add invoice row**. Download the sheet as Excel any time via File \u2192 Download \u2192 .xlsx."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    }
